# Module Rules

## apps/web — Landing page

- Uses **Tailwind CSS only** — no shadcn/ui or `@repo/ui`.
- 100% custom design: components live in `apps/web/src/components/` and never move to `packages/ui/`.
- Data fetching via TanStack Query — all fetching logic in `modules/landing/hooks/`.
- Optimized for SEO: prefer Server Components for the initial render; use Client Components only when interactivity or TanStack Query hooks are needed.
- All images use `next/image` with explicit `width`, `height`, and `alt`.
- Animation is allowed (CSS or Framer Motion) but must respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.

```tsx
// apps/web/src/app/page.tsx — Server Component that composes sections
import { HeroSection }     from '@/components/HeroSection';
import { FeaturesSection } from '@/components/FeaturesSection';
import { CtaSection }      from '@/components/CtaSection';

export const metadata = {
  title: 'Portfolio | Home',
  description: 'Web developer portfolio',
};

export default function LandingPage(): React.JSX.Element {
  return (
    <>
      <HeroSection />
      <FeaturesSection />
      <CtaSection />
    </>
  );
}
```

