## Route constants — each app defines its own

Routes are never hardcoded in components. Each app has its own routes file:

```typescript
// apps/admin/src/lib/constants/routes.constants.ts
export const ROUTES = {
  login:     '/login',
  admin: {
    dashboard: '/dashboard',
    posts: {
      list:   '/posts',
      new:    '/posts/new',
      edit:   (id: string) => `/posts/${id}/edit`,
    },
  },
} as const;
```

```typescript
// apps/blog/src/lib/constants/routes.constants.ts
export const ROUTES = {
  home:   '/',
  detail: (slug: string) => `/${slug}`,
} as const;
```
